@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/classBookings

### 1. Obtener todas las reservas de clase
GET {{baseUrl}}

### 2. Obtener una reserva por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/1

### 3. Crear una reserva de clase inicial
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberId": 1,
  "classSessionId": 15
}

### 4. Intentar duplicar reserva activa (espera 409 Conflicto)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberId": 1,
  "classSessionId": 15
}

### 5. Cancelar reserva mediante PATCH (status: CANCELLED)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/17
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CANCELLED"
}

### 6. Re-reservar la misma sesión tras cancelación por PATCH (POST reactiva la reserva con 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberId": 1,
  "classSessionId": 20
}

### 7. Cancelar / Eliminar una reserva (soft-delete via DELETE)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/15

### 8. Re-reservar la misma sesión tras soft-delete (POST reactiva y resetea deletedAt a null con 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberId": 1,
  "classSessionId": 15
}

### 9. Cancelar nuevamente via DELETE para probar reactivación por PATCH
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/15

### 10. Reactivar reserva soft-deleted directamente mediante PATCH (status: CONFIRMED)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CONFIRMED"
}
